# Obsidian vault

Working notes live in `vault/` at the repository root. Start from `vault/Home.md` and `vault/TODO.md`.

- Repo docs (`README.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `docs/`) are the published source of truth. The vault is tasks, hardware logs, and decisions.
- After finishing work, update `vault/TODO.md` (check off, add, or move items to Done).
- Log physical restores in `vault/Hardware Testing.md`. Add a `vault/Decisions.md` entry only for a choice that is not already there.
- Use wiki links `[[Note]]`. Do not copy the README into the vault.
